WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.490
<i>May 1789.</i>

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:17.310
<i>Dissatisfied with their poverty stricken lives and
the royal household, the voice of the people...</i>

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:20.100
<i>...had finally prevailed and the Estates-General was convened.</i>

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.280
<i>However, the Estates-General
was in turmoil from the start,</i>

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:29.300
<i>and showed no sign of cohesion
for all the time that had passed.</i>

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:33.960
<i>On one side were the Third Estate
representatives, hopeful for the new era.</i>

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:38.460
<i>Opposite to them were the First and Second Estate
representatives, whose aim was to protect the old regime.</i>

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:43.690
<i>The contentious assembly went
on endlessly, without a break.</i>

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:53.070
I heard Robespierre is making
an important speech today.

00:00:53.070 --> 00:00:54.480
Robespierre is?

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:55.740
I see.

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:58.070
If anyone, he might be able
to resolve this situation.

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:04.300
Gentlemen!

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:10.260
We are the representatives of the Third Estate,
which compromises 96% of the people of France!

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:14.360
For that reason, we are the true
representatives of France!

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:15.430
Therefore,

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:18.930
this is our proposal to the representatives
of the First and Second Estate!

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:20.290
Truth be told,

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:24.200
you only represent 4% of France!

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:27.430
If you truly wish to represent France,

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:31.440
you have no other option but to join hands with us,
the representatives of the Third Estate!

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:33.550
That's right! Join us!

00:01:33.550 --> 00:01:37.690
For all of France's sake, you should work alongside us!

00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:39.410
Stop catering to the interests...

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:41.700
...of the privileged class who are so few in number!

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.530
We'll let you join us!

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:44.590
Wake up already!

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:46.080
Your time is over!

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:48.330
I agree!

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:50.790
I'll work alongside the
commoners' representatives!

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:58.170
Among the nobles, Marquis La Fayette and Duke
Orléans' group have joined the commoners.

00:01:58.170 --> 00:01:59.890
It's getting interesting.

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:02.710
If the representatives of the Third Estate
take control of the Estates-General,

00:02:02.710 --> 00:02:06.040
then technically French politics falls
into our, the commoners' hands.

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:09.050
That aside, I'm a bit worn out.

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:11.890
Yeah, we've been here for 6 weeks
straight without a day off.

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:12.730
Where's the Commander?

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:13.990
She's probably out patrolling.

00:02:13.990 --> 00:02:16.460
I saw her walking alone towards the
Palace of Versailles a short while ago.

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:17.250
André.

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:21.790
About your, um, Commander...
She looks a bit pale.

00:02:22.740 --> 00:02:24.230
I just hope it's from fatigue...

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:29.230
A new France will emerge
from the Estates-General.

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:35.240
My duty is to protect the assembly and
representatives, so it can succeed.

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:38.170
Hang in there, Oscar.

